simulation code and the atlas comparisons:

  * aparc_fs5.npz — Desikan-Killiany atlas labels read from FreeSurfer's
    fsaverage5 lh/rh.aparc.annot (FreeSurfer Software License Agreement).
    Desikan, R. S. et al. NeuroImage 31, 968-980 (2006).

