Runtime dependencies (NOT redistributed here)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
These must be installed separately by the user; no part of them ships with SMOOTH.

  * FieldTrip — https://www.fieldtriptoolbox.org
    GNU General Public License v3.0.

  * FreeSurfer — https://surfer.nmr.mgh.harvard.edu
    FreeSurfer Software License Agreement. Used only for its surface files
    (fsaverage / fsaverage5); no FreeSurfer processing is performed. The surface
    readers smooth/utils/smooth_read_surf.m and python/smoothstat.py read_surface
    follow the file format of FreeSurfer's read_surf.m and read_curv.m.
